# Loops.so waitlist form (public form ID — safe for NEXT_PUBLIC_*)
# Paste from Loops dashboard → Forms → Settings → Form Endpoint
# (the ID is the last path segment of https://app.loops.so/api/newsletter-form/<FORM_ID>).
# Set the same var on Vercel project earlyaf-web, then redeploy.
# Leave empty to show the Coming soon / disabled placeholder.
NEXT_PUBLIC_LOOPS_FORM_ID=
